# Cache headers for Cloudflare Pages (copied into dist/ by the build).
#
# Everything is revalidated before reuse ("no-cache" caches, then asks "still current?"
# and usually gets a tiny 304), so a deploy shows up at once. The exception is /assets/:
# Vite names those files by their content hash, so a changed file gets a new name and
# the old one can be kept for a year without ever going stale.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
